rue,"releaseDate":"2011-05-26T20:51:47Z","version":"2.731.942","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"ROBLOX – MILLIONS OF GAMES ACROSS EVERY GENRE. PLAY FREE.\n\nRoblox is home to every kind of game, for every kind of player. Compete in high-octane racing games, battle it out in hardcore tactical shooters, or put your survival skills to the test in unpredictable environments. Embark on an epic adventure in immersive RPGs, build massive empires in tycoons, or dive into horror, anime, and sports games with friends worldwide.\n\nRoblox is constantly evolving, with unique experiences and ambitious, high-fidelity games built by a global community including professional studios, indie teams, and solo creators. There’s always something new to discover every day.\n\nStart playing some of the most popular games on Roblox today, including Dress to Impress, RIVALS, Steal a Brainrot, Brookhaven RP, Adopt Me! and more.\n\nWHAT YOU CAN DO ON ROBLOX\n\nPLAY ONLINE MULTIPLAYER GAMES\n- Discover deep role-playing games, immersive simulators, action-packed adventures, and more\n- Explore trending experiences and new games daily\n- Compete in massive multiplayer battles, run your own digital business, or embark on epic quests\n- Games may contain optional in-game purchases, including lootboxes and other items\n\nCREATE YOUR OWN AVATAR\n- Customize your avatar with detailed clothing, accessories, and dynamic hairstyles\n- Discover thousands of user-created 3D avatar items in the Marketplace\n- Express yourself with unique emotes, and fashion\n\nCHAT, COMPETE, AND EXPLORE TOGETHER—ANYTIME, ANYWHERE\n- Hang out and play with friends in cross-platform multiplayer games on mobile, tablet, PC, console, and VR headsets\n- Join a Party and jump into competitive or social experiences together\n- Age-verified users can communicate in real-time via voice chat or text\n\nCREATE, PLAY, AND SHARE ON ROBLOX\n- Design high-fidelity games and virtual spaces using the Roblox Studio engine on Windows or Mac\n- Publish your experiences and empower yourself as a creator in a massive global community\n- Dive into immersive 3D multiplayer games and safe, inclusive environments designed for users of all ages\n- Enjoy endless new content added daily and share your creations with millions of players\n\nELEVATE YOUR EXPERIENCE WITH ROBLOX PLUS\n- Get up to 20% discounts on in-game items, enjoy fee-free Robux transfers, and receive a distinct profile badge\n- Host free, unlimited private servers for your friends \n- Publish, trade, and resell your own custom avatar creations on the Marketplace\n\nINDUSTRY-LEADING SAFETY, PRIVACY, AND CIVILITY\n- Advanced content filtering and age-appropriate moderation\n- Access age-verified spaces and manage your privacy with Roblox Kids and Select Accounts\n- Clear community guidelines promoting respectful interactions\n- Dedicated trust & safety teams working around the clock\n\nCREATE YOUR OWN GAMES: https://www.roblox.com/develop\nSUPPORT: https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us\nCONTACT: https://corp.roblox.com/contact/\nPRIVACY POLICY: https://www.roblox.com/info/privacy\nPARENT’S GUIDE: https://corp.roblox.com/parents/\nTERMS OF USE: https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us/articles/115004647846\n\nPLEASE NOTE: A network connection is required. Roblox works best over Wi-Fi.\"","averageUserRating":4.51413,"trackCensoredName":"Roblox","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/roblox/id431946152?uo=4","contentAdvisoryRating":"12+","sellerName":"Roblox Corporation","userRatingCount":240416}